Title: Run queue jobs on a WorkerPool for 4x throughput
Body:
Moves job execution onto the existing WorkerPool so up to four jobs run in parallel, a 4x throughput gain.

- Added tests for concurrent pushes in test/queue.test.js
- Benchmarked: 4.1x faster on 1,000 jobs
- Updated the README with the new options

PatchBond: patchbond-e2e.testnet
